Package: iod25
Title: English Indices of Deprivation (IoD25)
Version: 0.0.0.9006
Date: 2026-06-01
Authors@R: 
    person("Douglas", "Munro", , "douglas@douglasmunro.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-6533-6423"))
Description: Data package containing the Indices of Deprivation 2025
    (IoD25).  Iod25 provide a set of relative measures of deprivation for
    small areas (Lower-layer Super Output Areas) across England.  Contains
    public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence
    v3.0.
